            <title>[LU-21195] recovery-small test_200: RPC did not time out</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21195</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;recovery-small test_200 fails with "RPC did not time out": after a delayed obd ping (fail_loc 0x80000535), the client debug log has no "Request sent has timed out .* o400-&amp;gt;" line within the wait window (recovery-small.sh, test_200 loop). The earlier checks pass (fail_loc hit, delayed send woke, more than one o400 sent to OST0000), so only the timeout message is missing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;First seen 2026-11-09; no LU ticket covers it. Failures so far (all "RPC did not time out"):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="alternate" type="square"&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-master full-dne-zfs-part-1 (el10.2): &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/c2f76d50-cb4a-46f4-aa65-52b39684d5a8" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/c2f76d50-cb4a-46f4-aa65-52b39684d5a8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-master-next full-part-1: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/48879de2-6b36-4204-808d-94f1b907bbab" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/48879de2-6b36-4204-808d-94f1b907bbab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;review of change 60995 ps25 review-dne-part-5: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/fed46f78-ff72-41cd-97dd-0bba5ff7380c" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/fed46f78-ff72-41cd-97dd-0bba5ff7380c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;review of change 70419 ps3 review-dne-zfs-part-5 (el9.8 zfs): &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/ee98f25b-bcee-4e68-ab1c-62bf8aae5125" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/ee98f25b-bcee-4e68-ab1c-62bf8aae5125&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Rate is low (about 4 of 5000 suite runs in 30 days, roughly 4 percent on the configurations where it has failed). It looks like a timing race in the test (the pinger or idle disconnect interacting with the delayed ping, or the loop window of delay+1 seconds ending before the timeout message is logged), not a regression from any one patch: it hits master, master-next and unrelated reviews.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-70419-ps3-5615ea9f40b3 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70419" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70419&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
